(305, 249, 'What is a laser marking machine?', 'A laser marking machine uses a focused laser beam to create text, logos, barcodes, serial numbers, patterns or identification marks on a material surface.', 1, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(306, 249, 'What materials can be laser marked?', 'Material compatibility depends on the laser source. Applications can include gold, silver, stainless steel, aluminium, brass, plastics and coated materials.', 2, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(307, 249, 'What is the difference between marking and engraving?', 'Laser marking changes the appearance of the surface, while engraving generally removes material to create measurable depth.', 3, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(308, 249, 'Can a laser marker create photographs and logos?', 'Yes. Suitable software can convert text, vector artwork, logos, serial numbers and selected image formats into marking files.', 4, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(309, 249, 'What information is needed before selecting a machine?', 'The supplier should understand the following:\n• Material type\n• Required marking depth\n• Marking-area size\n• Production volume\n• Required speed\n• Artwork type\n• Part shape\n• Automation requirements', 5, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(310, 249, 'Does the machine require consumables?', 'Laser marking normally does not require ink or printing plates. Some maintenance items may still be required depending on the machine configuration and operating environment.', 6, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(311, 250, 'What is a laser marking machine?', 'A laser marking machine uses a focused laser beam to create text, logos, barcodes, serial numbers, patterns or identification marks on a material surface.', 1, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(312, 250, 'What materials can be laser marked?', 'Material compatibility depends on the laser source. Applications can include gold, silver, stainless steel, aluminium, brass, plastics and coated materials.', 2, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(313, 250, 'What is the difference between marking and engraving?', 'Laser marking changes the appearance of the surface, while engraving generally removes material to create measurable depth.', 3, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
