(334, 467, 'Does the machine require consumables?', 'Laser marking normally does not require ink or printing plates. Some maintenance items may still be required depending on the machine configuration and operating environment.', 6, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(335, 262, 'What is a laser welding machine?', 'A laser welding machine uses concentrated laser energy to create precise welds on metal components. It is widely used for jewellery repair, precision assembly and fine metal joining.', 1, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(336, 262, 'What materials can be laser welded?', 'Depending on the machine and welding parameters, applications may include gold, silver, platinum, stainless steel, titanium and other compatible metals.', 2, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(337, 262, 'Does laser welding damage nearby stones?', 'Laser welding provides localized heating and can reduce heat transfer compared with many conventional welding methods. Suitability still depends on the setting, distance from the weld and selected parameters.', 3, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(338, 262, 'What parameters affect the weld?', 'Important parameters include:\n• Pulse energy\n• Pulse duration\n• Spot size\n• Repetition rate\n• Focus position\n• Material thickness\n• Joint design', 4, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(339, 262, 'Why is argon gas used?', 'Argon can help reduce oxidation and discoloration around the weld area, particularly for reactive or appearance-sensitive materials.', 5, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(340, 262, 'Is operator training required?', 'Yes. Operators should be trained in machine operation, parameter selection, sample positioning, routine maintenance and laser-safety procedures.', 6, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
