(365, 249, 'What is a laser cutting machine?', 'A laser cutting machine uses focused laser energy to cut detailed shapes and patterns from suitable materials.', 1, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(366, 249, 'What factors determine cutting quality?', 'Cutting quality depends on laser power, material type, thickness, focus, cutting speed and the accuracy of the design file.', 2, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(367, 249, 'Which file formats can be used?', 'Supported formats depend on the machine software. Commonly used production files include  PLT , JPG and vector file.', 3, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(368, 249, 'Can one machine cut every metal thickness?', 'No. Maximum thickness depends on the laser source, power, material and required edge quality.\nINDUSTRIAL WEIGHING\nScales, load cells and indicators for production, warehousing, logistics and process weighing.', 4, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
