(543, 545, 'What is an ice flake maker?', 'It produces small, irregular flakes of ice that provide broad surface contact and conform easily around containers or products.', 1, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(544, 545, 'What water quality should be used?', 'Use feed water that meets the manufacturer requirements. Poor water quality can cause scale, odour, reduced output and hygiene problems.', 2, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(545, 545, 'Why does ice production decrease?', 'Possible causes include high ambient or inlet-water temperature, inadequate ventilation, scale buildup, restricted water supply, dirty condensers or refrigeration faults.', 3, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(546, 545, 'How should the storage bin be maintained?', 'Keep the bin clean and closed, remove old ice, follow the sanitization schedule and avoid using the bin as a general storage compartment.', 4, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(547, 545, 'Is the ice suitable for direct consumption?', 'Only when the machine, water supply and sanitation program are specifically managed for food-grade use. Laboratory-use ice should not automatically be treated as potable.', 5, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(548, 545, 'What installation conditions are important?', 'Provide adequate ventilation, drainage, level support, suitable power and water connections, and the ambient conditions specified for the unit.', 6, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
(549, 546, 'What is an ice flake maker?', 'It produces small, irregular flakes of ice that provide broad surface contact and conform easily around containers or products.', 1, '2026-09-21 06:17:26', '2026-09-21 06:17:26'),
